{"login": "saraimarte", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "98d38a6fcb9bf7d210b6df7f40561cb66667e9f1", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-03-18T16:35:57Z", "repo": "JanMarch2023NotionxTwitter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "06cc86eea5b5b8b05f14c2624f5e6f987cb533e4", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nThis version takes into account if there are not any a, b or e locations. Allows for small datasets of locations.", "created_at": "2023-05-30T01:56:43Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cd1b2ce7f44be845e8af31c8f745cf59d0090249", "message": "Update newRouteV4\n\nThis version takes into account if there are not any a, b or e locations. Allows for small datasets of locations.", "created_at": "2023-05-30T01:53:26Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6637632b87e61fd82fbeb709a009cef89d2dc8b", "message": "Rename newRouteV3.1 to newRouteV4\n\nThis version takes into account if there are not any a, b or e locations. Allows for small datasets of locations.", "created_at": "2023-05-30T01:52:40Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a2191c0de71337cc76ef521b354601dede2750ad", "message": "Create newRouteV3.1\n\nHaven't ran it yet but its suppose to take into account cases where there are no a or b or e locations in the dataframe", "created_at": "2023-05-29T05:16:33Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f68a52b87acf9e1dc929bed437e6c9e922595bf8", "message": "Version 3\n\nThis version returns a dataframe with all locations including the new stops and the distances and durations between each one!", "created_at": "2023-05-27T04:48:32Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a71381322ee4b6fad7134af1268202501e230a71", "message": "none", "created_at": "2023-05-27T04:47:35Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "31df16a45369a0842af3e0db98421f99eac95364", "message": "Rename newRouteV3 (1).csv to newRouteV3.csv\n\nResults for version 3 include distance in miles and duration in minutes between each stop!", "created_at": "2023-05-27T03:58:48Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1c64e2d51a4a443ecba7470e45cb0ad9bebd48d8", "message": "Create mainV3.py", "created_at": "2023-05-27T03:57:40Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "32d6e1cd32689d27c6d617db989f5a8728820fca", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-05-27T03:56:05Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a335cbf7c1c0e993b6940e0aeb7c44837d3343a1", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-05-27T03:55:45Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "845ff3659b3ab457f111343e3a189ea7779e5c19", "message": "Create mainV2.1.py\n\nThis version returns the new route with duration and distance data. Not 100% correct however. Also, accounted for when there is no nextStop after the closestLocation or newStop. Need to do the same for when there are no stops before.", "created_at": "2023-05-26T03:16:36Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa3652bdc56edc9da58831204cdca450800298b9", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nResults for version 2.1. Results show durations and distances from one location to the next. The durations are not correct especially towards the end. Need to fix.", "created_at": "2023-05-26T03:12:49Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "670ea2dca31b63b7339026801314e27ae78837bd", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nThis CSV shows the need for more locations referenced (a, b, c, d). With too few locations referenced, it may not grasp the actual difference between both case scenarios (adding new stop before or after its closest stop). Take a look at stop 614 here vrs in newRouteV2.csv", "created_at": "2023-05-23T23:51:04Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "21a56245381dd84f129e4a6ab6646775766ff160", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nResults for Version 2. All new stops are placed in an optimized location intended to make the route time shorter.", "created_at": "2023-05-23T23:49:05Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "662a438b55c4a198976331727bedf58d79baee00", "message": "Create mainv2.py\n\nAdded functionality to determine the optimal placement of new stops. Achieved this by identifying the closest location and calculating the duration of adding new stops before or after it, with reference to surrounding locations. Whichever case scenario took the least time would be the one that is chosen.", "created_at": "2023-05-23T23:45:04Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ca45e9f58d49af5ba7d1bd98c1ad390b3bfe58ce", "message": "Delete mainv2.py", "created_at": "2023-05-23T23:44:22Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c967e748680f6f8d977c8bf8810d8cec0c8d9209", "message": "Rename newRoute (1).csv to newRouteV2.csv", "created_at": "2023-05-23T22:22:53Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0ae434b27bc7e46a833b6bf9869dc6689fe5257f", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2023-05-23T22:22:33Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fc092c303c3245eccdcc94964503791501b8efd6", "message": "Create mainv2.py\n\nAdded functionality to determine the optimal placement of new stops. Achieved this by identifying the closest location and calculating the duration of adding new stops before or after it, with reference to surrounding locations. Whichever case scenario took the least time would be the one that is chosen.", "created_at": "2023-05-23T22:19:09Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "10157ace92bb04b422cd981dc64e774fcae572da", "message": "Rename main.py to mainv1.py", "created_at": "2023-05-23T21:52:48Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cadbf68a77a7defbd3d5b542ca0997f3cec2f0a3", "message": "Add Data \n\nThis is the demo data used to test the code for version 1. It brings up a problem: what happens if the newStop is not closest to any current stops but the last one? np.insert replaces stops not adds stops so I added an if statement to account for the addition of the new stop to the end of the route if that's where it belongs.", "created_at": "2023-05-22T20:25:00Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0601af4f564f075505c64011f313eddfe6fe535f", "message": "Add data", "created_at": "2023-05-22T20:23:05Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5c240446538402753ffdecb5bd98b7296e79f7e5", "message": "Rename newRoute.csv to newRouteV1.csv", "created_at": "2023-05-22T20:17:45Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0fbde9b09deee720d614d1a3241d82789513c592", "message": "Add data", "created_at": "2023-05-22T20:17:21Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "501370d0827f0370b90fd57dcc76cb86315b87dd", "message": "Version 1\n\nThis version takes all the new stops for a route and finds which current stops they are the closest to and then automatically inserts the new stop right after that current location in the dataframe. The final result is a new route with the new stops added (in a way that optimizes the route duration).\r\n\r\nProblem: There are cases where the new stop is closest to a current location and it is therefore put right after it in the new route but sometimes, the new stop is actually on the way to the current location not right after. I have to answer the question: How can I find if the new stop is before or after the current location? (How can I find if the new stop is between the previous location and the current closest location?)", "created_at": "2023-05-22T20:16:15Z", "repo": "May2023Routes", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "73f7f9420c5628ef89a61052401b89fc5fbf976c", "message": "Create style1.7.css", "created_at": "2023-07-09T00:39:19Z", "repo": "AccountingProjectA", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03436b5a510a24547db3a584709ce8ba7bc35229", "message": "Create script1.7.js", "created_at": "2023-07-09T00:38:59Z", "repo": "AccountingProjectA", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ab2824c5e03d02d9e8bf3406b9209252b5d7b42", "message": "Changed Color Theme", "created_at": "2023-07-09T00:38:46Z", "repo": "AccountingProjectA", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "56cd0d80577337275fcb19c3df45032eb3d70a8e", "message": "Create style1.6.css", "created_at": "2023-07-07T20:48:02Z", "repo": "AccountingProjectA", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9d62bcd9086a8b85b9ccce9816fd651e7ca67de", "message": "Create script1.6.js", "created_at": "2023-07-07T20:47:40Z", "repo": "AccountingProjectA", 